&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain frontend components using React, Next.js, TypeScript, HTML, and CSS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help develop decentralized applications (dApps) that integrate Web2 and Web3 APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
